<script>
const faqs = [
    ["What types of vehicles do you detail?", "We provide professional detailing for compact cars, sedans, SUVs, trucks, and luxury automobiles."],
    ["Do I need an appointment?", "Yes, we operate strictly by appointment to ensure each vehicle receives the highest quality of care."],
    ["How long does a detailing service take?", "Exterior (30–50 mins), Interior (45–60 mins), and Full Detailing (1–1.5 hours)."],
    ["Do you come to my location?", "Yes, we are a fully mobile service. We bring our expertise directly to your home or office."],
    ["Can I customize a package?", "Absolutely. We are happy to tailor our services to meet your specific requirements."],
    ["Do you offer interior-only or exterior-only services?", "Yes, both services are available as individual options through our booking menu."],
    ["Do you offer ceramic coating or paint protection?", "We use high-quality waxes and sealants. Inquire about our premium protection options."],
